              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek. 34.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omukholi wase Daudi akhabe omwami wabwe, lundi boosi alala balaba nende omwayi mulala. Bakhaloonde kamalakiilisia kase ne khuuba barekeerefu khuloonda lilaka liase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakhamenye mu sibala nisio naelesia raarawabwe Yakobo. Mu sibala nimwo baraara babwe baamenyanga; nibo ne babaana babwe ne babechukhulu babwe bakhamenye ebweeneyo buli lwoosi. Daudi omukholi wase akhabe omwami wabwe buli lwoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khakhole endakaano eye kumuleembe ne nabo, ekhabe endakaano eya mindali ne nabo. Khababiite chikhabi mala mbakuchisie. Khabombakhemo abuundu wase aatakatifu ababeemo mindali na mindali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
